        "## 1. Question\n",
        "Title: Predictive Content Opportunity Scoring: A Machine Learning Approach to SEO Refresh Prioritization\n",
        "\n",
        "Abstract:\n",
        "Content and SEO teams often struggle to identify which decaying pages offer the best return on investment for a manual refresh. To solve this, this study utilizes search performance data to build a predictive opportunity scoring engine. A Random Forest model was trained to score content potential, utilizing a strict GroupShuffleSplit methodology to prevent data leakage. Finally, the model's outputs are translated into a ranked action playbook, mapping scores to specific human-in-the-loop recommendations.\n",
        "\n",
        "The Research Question:\n",
        "How can we identify and rank decaying web pages that offer the highest return on investment for manual content refreshes?\n",
        "\n",
        "The Decision it Supports:\n",
        "This research supports content strategists and SEO teams in prioritizing their update queues. Instead of relying on subjective guesswork, teams can use this data-driven scoring engine to allocate resources efficiently towards pages that have the highest potential for recovery."
      ],
