        "## 2. Data\n",
        "Dataset Details & Public Safety:\n",
        "This analysis utilizes the FlyRank ML Internship dataset hosted on Hugging Face.\n",
        "\n",
        "Table Used: fact_content_daily_performance\n",
        "\n",
        "Date Window: February 2026 (month=2026-02)\n",
        "\n",
        "Exclusions: Records with zero impressions (gsc_impressions <= 0) or missing position data (gsc_avg_position IS NOT NULL) were excluded to ensure the model only evaluates pages with an active search presence.\n",
