        "## 4. Results (vs baseline)\n",
        "Model vs. Baseline Evaluation:The comparison below demonstrates the critical difference between over-optimistic random splitting and honest grouped splitting.Split DesignEvaluationMeasured RMSE (Lower is better)Random SplitOver-optimistic (Baseline)Artificially LowGrouped by ClientHonest (Real-world)Higher, but realisticNote: The Random Split allows client-specific data to leak across the train/test boundary, causing the model to memorize client behaviors. The Grouped Split evaluates the model on completely unseen clients, providing a true measure of its ability to generalize across new websites."
