        "## 5. Limitations\n",
        "\n",
        "Honest Claims & Boundaries:\n",
        "\n",
        "Correlation vs. Causation: This model identifies correlations between visibility metrics and click opportunities. A high opportunity score suggests potential, but it does not guarantee that a manual refresh will causally result in increased traffic.\n",
        "\n",
        "Semantic Blindness: The model analyzes quantitative metrics (impressions, positions), not qualitative content. It cannot determine if a page is struggling due to poor writing quality, outdated facts, or external factors like a lack of backlinks.\n",
        "\n",
        "Algorithm Volatility: The system is built on historical trailing data (February 2026). It cannot predict or account for sudden search engine algorithm updates or real-time viral trends."
      ],
      "id": "pKwXL1hcCXq_"
