        "## 6. Ranked recommendations\n",
        "\n",
        "The Action Playbook:\n",
        "Based on the opportunity score and traffic decay signals, the model categorizes URLs into the following prioritized actions:\n",
        "\n",
        "Full Rewrite: (High Opportunity + Active Decay) Content needs a complete structural and semantic overhaul.\n",
        "\n",
        "Expand Content: (High Opportunity + Stable Traffic) Content is performing reasonably well but lacks the depth to capture available clicks.\n",
        "\n",
        "Refresh Links/Dates: (Medium Opportunity + Minor Decay) Quick SEO wins requiring minimal effort.\n",
        "\n",
        "Monitor: (Low Opportunity) Low priority; not worth manual resource allocation at this time.\n",
        "\n",
        "Human-in-the-Loop Rules:\n",
        "This system is a prioritization engine, not a content generator. All \"Rewrite\" or \"Expand\" recommendations must be reviewed by a human content strategist. Automated, direct-to-site overwriting using LLMs is strictly prohibited."
      ],
